WEBVTT

00:00:01.573 --> 00:00:10.641
<i>GRENADIER</i>

00:00:10.882 --> 00:00:20.382
<i>Carving my footsteps
in the amber colored road...</i>

00:00:20.492 --> 00:00:30.197
<i>... I've finally come this far.
I keep my eyes on the road ahead.</i>

00:00:30.469 --> 00:00:39.605
<i>Only time moves faster than me...</i>

00:00:40.012 --> 00:00:50.149
<i>I look back...
the road behind me shines blue.</i>

00:00:51.156 --> 00:00:57.117
<i>The flames of all the lives
I've encountered...</i>

00:00:57.329 --> 00:01:00.730
<i>I wish I could hold them in my arms.</i>

00:01:00.899 --> 00:01:06.565
<i>So that we don't get swept away
by this great river...</i>

00:01:06.705 --> 00:01:10.232
<i>... I want our hearts to be one.</i>

00:01:10.409 --> 00:01:19.408
<i>We're all travelers, after all.</i>

00:01:44.342 --> 00:01:46.640
Hey there, mister.

00:01:47.512 --> 00:01:48.706
Mister!

00:01:48.847 --> 00:01:49.905
Shut up!

00:01:50.382 --> 00:01:54.910
Oh, that nasty look, it's you,
Big Brother Ganzo.

00:01:55.220 --> 00:02:00.556
Sorry about the nasty look. If you
don't have any business with me, scram.

00:02:00.692 --> 00:02:05.356
We heard Ganzo of Tenmatoh
is famous for his strong arms!

00:02:05.697 --> 00:02:06.789
Yeah!

00:02:07.199 --> 00:02:08.723
Of course!

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.833
Don't take this here Ganzo lightly.

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:15.037
Can you move this stone for us?

00:02:17.109 --> 00:02:20.374
We'd like to see this famous
strength of yours.

00:02:20.679 --> 00:02:22.078
S-Sure!

00:02:31.656 --> 00:02:34.682
Wow! He's so manly.

00:02:35.127 --> 00:02:39.496
If we didn't have guests,
we'd happily pour your sake for you.

00:02:40.465 --> 00:02:42.433
Go Mister Ganzo!

00:02:43.201 --> 00:02:44.634
You're great.

00:02:46.738 --> 00:02:49.935
What a magnificent view!
A magnificent view!

00:02:50.375 --> 00:02:54.175
Hey, are the blue prints
for the extension finished?

00:02:54.346 --> 00:02:56.814
Of course they are, as you can see!

00:02:57.015 --> 00:03:00.473
You're awesome! Gadget
master Zoushi Banmaru!

00:03:00.585 --> 00:03:03.918
Being told that is... wonderful!

00:03:07.592 --> 00:03:11.688
<i>Episode 7
Destination Tento</i>

00:03:12.631 --> 00:03:16.965
Miss Touka, everyone,
thank you for everything.

00:03:17.102 --> 00:03:19.593
So, are you going to the capital?

00:03:19.871 --> 00:03:20.633
Yes.

00:03:21.072 --> 00:03:25.600
I want to see Tenshi and ask her
personally what is going on.

00:03:25.777 --> 00:03:26.744
I see.

00:03:32.651 --> 00:03:34.619
Wait, Rushuna!

00:03:37.289 --> 00:03:39.223
I'm going with you!

00:03:39.658 --> 00:03:40.283
Huh?

00:03:40.992 --> 00:03:42.220
Mikan...

00:03:42.527 --> 00:03:45.860
I can't believe you were going
to leave me behind, Rushuna!

00:03:45.997 --> 00:03:48.864
You're my partner starting today.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:49.967
Huh?

00:03:50.135 --> 00:03:53.070
That's not your decision to make!

00:03:53.438 --> 00:03:55.429
I already decided.

00:03:55.574 --> 00:03:57.269
It's okay, right?

00:03:57.542 --> 00:03:59.567
Uh, but...

00:04:03.949 --> 00:04:06.076
It's okay, right, Touka?

00:04:06.551 --> 00:04:09.782
I can't stop a girl who
wants to go on a journey.

00:04:09.888 --> 00:04:12.413
Take care of her, Rushuna.

00:04:12.824 --> 00:04:14.917
Yes! I will.

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:17.719
Mikan, welcome aboard.

00:04:17.862 --> 00:04:19.887
Thanks a lot.

00:04:23.201 --> 00:04:24.668
Be careful.

00:04:25.103 --> 00:04:29.938
Just don't ever forget
that this is your home.

00:04:30.208 --> 00:04:32.005
Okay, thanks.

00:04:36.147 --> 00:04:39.810
Yajiro, let's go!
Stop dragging your feet!

00:04:43.555 --> 00:04:46.820
Well then everyone, take care.

00:04:57.669 --> 00:05:01.628
Mikan, don't take your
eyes off Yajiro.

00:05:01.773 --> 00:05:02.967
He's...

00:05:03.708 --> 00:05:05.733
<i>A YEAR AND A HALF AGO</i>

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:19.753
He was a swordsman fighting
with the rebel army.

00:05:26.798 --> 00:05:27.924
Toukarou?

00:05:28.199 --> 00:05:28.858
Yes.

00:05:29.134 --> 00:05:34.663
It is the pleasure palace run by Touka
Kurenai, one of the former Juttensen.

00:05:34.906 --> 00:05:38.034
And Rushuna Tendo is there...

00:05:38.176 --> 00:05:39.438
I see.

00:05:39.944 --> 00:05:44.608
Now she has left there and
is headed towards this capital city.

00:05:44.749 --> 00:05:49.448
Let her sleep. Sing her a lullaby.

00:05:49.587 --> 00:05:53.546
Yes ma'am.
The Blade Bard Senshi, Souma, right?

00:06:01.433 --> 00:06:03.867
Yajiro, don't look!

00:06:04.002 --> 00:06:05.970
Did you say something? Ow!

00:06:07.172 --> 00:06:08.506
I told you not to look!

00:06:08.506 --> 00:06:11.066
<i>I couldn't hear you!
I told you not to look!</i>

00:06:14.946 --> 00:06:16.811
This feels great!

00:06:17.816 --> 00:06:20.546
I'm handy to have around, aren't I?

00:06:20.652 --> 00:06:23.815
Yeah, your balloons are great, Mikan!

00:06:24.522 --> 00:06:28.754
Tomorrow we'll be going through the
checkpoint. We must bathe while we can.

00:06:28.993 --> 00:06:32.656
Why does that pervert
have to come with us?

00:06:33.531 --> 00:06:37.592
He hopes that if he's with me,
he'll be able to meet Tenshi.

00:06:38.103 --> 00:06:44.042
But he hates Tenshi, right?
So why should you help him see her?

00:06:44.442 --> 00:06:49.038
Yatchan is convinced
that she's a bad person.

00:06:49.514 --> 00:06:53.041
But I want him to see
that it's not true.

00:06:57.355 --> 00:06:59.084
They're so naive.

00:06:59.424 --> 00:07:03.952
Do she really think a fugitive can
pass through the checkpoint so easily?

00:07:11.636 --> 00:07:13.331
Yajiro Kojima.

00:07:14.038 --> 00:07:15.005
Who's that?

00:07:16.141 --> 00:07:19.235
You must not let that
woman near the capital.

00:07:19.344 --> 00:07:20.470
Who are you?

00:07:20.845 --> 00:07:25.077
If you ally yourself with that woman,
then you are an enemy!

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:27.184
What does that mean?

00:07:33.024 --> 00:07:35.788
I told you not to look over here!

00:07:41.065 --> 00:07:44.796
Heh, what will you do, Yajiro?

00:07:51.142 --> 00:07:53.702
Rushuna, the tent is pitched.

00:07:53.978 --> 00:07:56.310
Yatchan, why don't
you come sleep with us?

00:07:56.414 --> 00:08:00.578
Don't worry about me.
I have some thinking to do alone.

00:08:00.752 --> 00:08:01.776
I see.

00:08:02.921 --> 00:08:05.788
Don't catch a cold. Good night.

00:08:08.359 --> 00:08:11.920
What's going to happen if
Rushuna enters the capital?

00:08:12.931 --> 00:08:14.728
This'll be interesting.

00:08:33.518 --> 00:08:34.712
Tenshi...

00:08:36.955 --> 00:08:42.086
What are you going to do,
imprisoning me in this place?

00:08:42.327 --> 00:08:48.129
Your methods will not bring
an end to these war-torn times.

00:08:48.466 --> 00:08:50.400
By allowing the warlords to rule...

00:08:50.635 --> 00:08:54.935
...we will bring a time where
only the fittest will survive.

00:08:55.106 --> 00:08:58.598
This is the end result
that we are after.

00:09:00.111 --> 00:09:03.603
There will be much
bloodshed, once again.

00:09:03.915 --> 00:09:07.646
Sacrifices must be made
for times to change.

00:09:07.952 --> 00:09:10.420
There are other ways.

00:09:10.622 --> 00:09:14.820
You believe that there are those who
will make your ideals become reality.

00:09:14.926 --> 00:09:18.191
I will put an end to that dream.

00:09:19.597 --> 00:09:23.055
In order to see our plans through.

00:09:28.106 --> 00:09:31.303
<i>CHECKPOINT TWENTY THREE</i>

00:09:31.609 --> 00:09:33.577
Hey, someone's coming.

00:09:38.416 --> 00:09:40.213
That's...

00:09:42.754 --> 00:09:43.888
Doesn't that look like her?

00:09:43.888 --> 00:09:45.879
<i>It does!
Doesn't that look like her?</i>

00:09:46.024 --> 00:09:48.788
If we catch her,
we'll get 5,000 gold pieces!

00:09:48.893 --> 00:09:49.655
Yeah.

00:09:50.061 --> 00:09:53.189
But I've heard she's really strong.

00:09:53.364 --> 00:09:56.424
We're no match for her.

00:09:56.568 --> 00:10:00.060
But she could just look like her.

00:10:00.572 --> 00:10:04.770
Are you stupid? You're going
to walk right in the main gates?

00:10:04.909 --> 00:10:09.005
I didn't do anything wrong.
We can talk this out.

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:10.340
That's right.

00:10:10.615 --> 00:10:13.015
Stop right there!

00:10:13.151 --> 00:10:13.913
Okay.

00:10:14.052 --> 00:10:16.816
Show us something to identify yourself!

00:10:16.955 --> 00:10:18.980
Huh? I don't have anything.

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:19.784
Oh, no.

00:10:19.924 --> 00:10:22.324
Very suspicious.

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:24.525
It smells funny.

00:10:24.696 --> 00:10:27.028
But I just washed.

00:10:28.333 --> 00:10:30.801
What is your name?

00:10:31.536 --> 00:10:33.731
My name is Rushuna Tendo.

00:10:33.838 --> 00:10:35.567
It's her!

00:10:35.773 --> 00:10:35.974
Run!

00:10:35.974 --> 00:10:36.906
<i>What!
Run!</i>

00:10:37.141 --> 00:10:38.608
Huh? What's going on?

00:10:38.743 --> 00:10:40.711
No choice! Get her!

00:10:40.845 --> 00:10:41.402
Huh?

00:10:53.925 --> 00:10:56.120
Hurry! Charge!

00:10:59.263 --> 00:11:00.252
Rushuna!

00:11:04.669 --> 00:11:06.637
Rushuna, hurry, get in!

00:11:07.572 --> 00:11:08.504
Wow!

00:11:08.806 --> 00:11:11.104
It's a turtle balloon!

00:11:11.309 --> 00:11:13.277
<i>TURTLE BALLOON</i>

00:11:13.444 --> 00:11:15.844
This is fun!

00:11:16.414 --> 00:11:17.210
Isn't it?

00:11:19.283 --> 00:11:20.084
Wow! The bullets are bouncing off it!

00:11:20.084 --> 00:11:21.779
<i>Hey, I'm...
Wow! The bullets are bouncing off it!</i>

00:11:21.986 --> 00:11:22.453
<i>Listen, I'm...</i>

00:11:22.453 --> 00:11:24.512
<i>Listen, I'm...
It's coated with diamond dust!</i>

00:11:24.622 --> 00:11:27.318
<i>Hey, listen to me!
They won't make a single hole in it!</i>

00:11:27.492 --> 00:11:29.653
Let's go in like this then!

00:11:40.238 --> 00:11:42.206
Did something pass us?

00:11:42.607 --> 00:11:45.701
Just a balloon bouncing by.

00:11:45.843 --> 00:11:46.775
Right.

00:11:46.911 --> 00:11:48.071
Yeah.

00:11:52.116 --> 00:11:56.644
Your goal, to win without fighting...
This is what you mean by it, right?

00:11:56.788 --> 00:11:59.052
Yes! You got it, Mikan!

00:11:59.157 --> 00:12:00.522
All right!

00:12:00.658 --> 00:12:05.595
They're so reckless! As if it's
going to be that easy every time!

00:12:10.935 --> 00:12:12.425
Yajiro Kojima.

00:12:13.571 --> 00:12:18.235
If you are going to side with
that woman, you too will die!

00:12:20.545 --> 00:12:24.413
W-Who are you?

00:12:28.786 --> 00:12:29.878
Yatchan!

00:12:46.204 --> 00:12:48.297
Rushuna Tendo!

00:12:48.606 --> 00:12:50.437
Yatchan, are you okay?

00:12:50.541 --> 00:12:52.441
Hang in there, Yajiro!

00:12:52.677 --> 00:12:55.942
My real target is the woman!
Do it, Souma!

00:13:01.252 --> 00:13:02.116
Rushuna!

00:13:08.893 --> 00:13:12.158
So you're Rushuna Tendo?

00:13:12.663 --> 00:13:16.292
You want to know who I am?

00:13:17.301 --> 00:13:20.202
Mikan, take care of Yatchan.

00:13:20.338 --> 00:13:21.202
Okay.

00:13:21.472 --> 00:13:24.202
My name is Sanzo Souma.

00:13:24.308 --> 00:13:27.744
I am one of the Juttensen,
the Blade Bard Senshi, Souma!

00:13:27.912 --> 00:13:28.879
<i>JUTTENSEN</i>

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:30.911
Juttensen?

00:13:31.215 --> 00:13:34.844
Do you know why you're wanted?

00:13:36.020 --> 00:13:39.956
There's a misunderstanding.
If I can just see Tenshi...

00:13:40.091 --> 00:13:42.616
But Yatchan has nothing to do with this.

00:13:42.727 --> 00:13:46.094
By being with you, he must be killed.

00:13:46.664 --> 00:13:48.291
With me?

00:13:48.466 --> 00:13:49.433
Listen.

00:13:49.534 --> 00:13:54.233
Two things I hate most in this world
are dried mushrooms...

00:13:54.405 --> 00:13:56.498
...and conversation.

00:14:02.213 --> 00:14:07.583
You move fast. I'll compliment
you on that, young lady.

00:14:08.085 --> 00:14:10.076
How dare you harm Yatchan!

00:14:11.355 --> 00:14:15.086
Revenge, is this? But can you do it?

00:14:25.837 --> 00:14:28.032
Wh-What is this?

00:14:28.306 --> 00:14:29.398
Rushuna!

00:14:31.409 --> 00:14:33.900
What's wrong?

00:14:34.378 --> 00:14:36.346
M-My ears...

00:14:36.547 --> 00:14:39.345
Deep inside my ears... Was that...

00:14:41.919 --> 00:14:44.183
...the Kanonhou?

00:14:44.422 --> 00:14:48.222
Impressive observation.
You already figured it out.

00:14:48.326 --> 00:14:53.730
But dodging Souma's attack like
that is working against you.

00:14:54.665 --> 00:14:57.828
You've been hit by one of
the Ten Sacred Weapons...

00:14:57.969 --> 00:15:00.403
...the Kanonhou.

00:15:00.605 --> 00:15:05.133
Your sense of equilibrium has been lost
due to the damage to your inner ear.

00:15:05.309 --> 00:15:07.504
You can't even stand up.

00:15:07.645 --> 00:15:11.172
In that condition, you
can't even aim your gun.

00:15:12.416 --> 00:15:15.180
How dare you harm Yatchan!

00:15:30.268 --> 00:15:32.463
Destructive Wave Pulse!

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:35.366
A sound wave travels through air...

00:15:35.473 --> 00:15:40.001
The Kanonhou's power is
to amplify sound waves.

00:15:40.244 --> 00:15:43.873
The amplified sound waves
create a wall of air...

00:15:44.048 --> 00:15:48.849
...that stops all things dead in their tracks
and renders all things indefensible.

00:15:51.956 --> 00:15:52.888
Mikan!

00:15:53.291 --> 00:15:55.555
Give up!

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:58.490
There's nothing you can do.

00:15:58.596 --> 00:16:02.828
Just sit back while I strip you down
and blast you to pieces!

00:16:04.969 --> 00:16:09.338
Rushuna, what are you doing?
You're not your usual self!

00:16:10.641 --> 00:16:14.372
You're the one who said
revenge is useless, Rushuna!

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:18.976
I didn't see it.

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:22.779
I couldn't see my enemy
or his fighting skills.

00:16:28.859 --> 00:16:31.487
What are you doing?
Are you surrendering?

00:16:39.136 --> 00:16:42.128
What is she up to?

00:16:50.014 --> 00:16:52.847
Hmm? An eye for an eye?

00:16:58.089 --> 00:17:01.684
A sound for a sound.
Vibration for vibration.

00:17:01.826 --> 00:17:03.418
W-What!

00:17:03.694 --> 00:17:05.184
A spinning whistle...

00:17:05.296 --> 00:17:06.058
Yajiro!

00:17:06.731 --> 00:17:11.293
She's trying to cancel out his
vibrations with her sound waves.

00:17:20.277 --> 00:17:23.644
Girl! Don't underestimate me!

00:17:23.881 --> 00:17:27.146
I'm out of breath!

00:17:28.552 --> 00:17:30.452
He's out of breath!

00:17:30.554 --> 00:17:31.316
Now!

00:17:41.899 --> 00:17:44.101
Zero Range Target Shot!

00:17:44.101 --> 00:17:45.329
<i>ZERO RANGE TARGETSHOT
Zero Range Target Shot!</i>

00:17:45.569 --> 00:17:47.605
Tornado Impact!

00:17:47.605 --> 00:17:48.299
<i>TORNADO IMPACT
Tornado Impact!</i>

00:18:05.589 --> 00:18:06.248
Yatchan!

00:18:12.863 --> 00:18:15.263
W-Wait!

00:18:15.599 --> 00:18:19.399
Your weapon has been broken,
what's the good of pursuing her?

00:18:21.739 --> 00:18:24.902
I seek people who have
strength and power.

00:18:25.109 --> 00:18:29.375
I have no need for those who bring
shame to the name of the Juttensen!

00:18:29.513 --> 00:18:34.314
Wh-what are you doing?
Wait, please wait...

00:18:49.934 --> 00:18:52.664
It looks like his fever has gone down.

00:18:53.104 --> 00:18:54.332
That's great.

00:18:54.738 --> 00:18:57.605
But he's not waking up.

00:18:58.509 --> 00:19:01.637
I hope the herbs are
going to start working.

00:19:01.779 --> 00:19:04.145
I don't think you have to worry.

00:19:04.248 --> 00:19:05.237
Why?

00:19:05.483 --> 00:19:08.611
He opened his eyes earlier.

00:19:08.786 --> 00:19:09.718
Huh?

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:12.684
You'll see if you just
pop him a good one.

00:19:12.857 --> 00:19:13.949
Pop him?

00:19:14.158 --> 00:19:16.786
You want me to do it then?

00:19:20.064 --> 00:19:21.088
See?

00:19:21.298 --> 00:19:22.560
You're right!

00:19:22.666 --> 00:19:25.430
You twerp! Are you trying to kill me?

00:19:25.536 --> 00:19:26.525
Humph!

00:19:26.837 --> 00:19:28.304
I'm so glad!

00:19:28.405 --> 00:19:31.101
If you can move that well, you're fine!

00:19:34.011 --> 00:19:36.172
Yeah, I'm fine!

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:38.846
I was just messing with you.

00:19:38.949 --> 00:19:42.942
He's just jealous
because we're so tight.

00:19:43.053 --> 00:19:46.250
I see, you wanted us to worry about you.

00:19:46.457 --> 00:19:47.253
What!

00:19:47.992 --> 00:19:49.016
Yatchan...

00:19:49.326 --> 00:19:53.956
I'm sorry for not realizing.
We'll sleep together tonight, okay?

00:19:54.265 --> 00:19:57.666
Don't be stupid. I'm not a kid!

00:19:58.335 --> 00:20:02.362
All men are kids...
that's what Touka says.

00:20:02.673 --> 00:20:04.300
She's right.

00:20:11.248 --> 00:20:15.309
What's wrong, Yatchan?
You're just staring at the mountains.

00:20:15.586 --> 00:20:21.115
Nothing, are you serious about
going over those mountains?

00:20:22.326 --> 00:20:27.855
The most direct way to the
capital is over Charambo.

00:20:28.199 --> 00:20:31.862
Then we'll go over the mountains.

00:20:33.804 --> 00:20:39.606
Spirit Peak, Charambo. The wind and
the sheer rocks will stand on our way.

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:42.042
It's the danger of all dangers.

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:46.838
It might be easier to
go through the checkpoints.

00:20:46.984 --> 00:20:50.681
It's better than fighting
people and hurting them.

00:20:50.888 --> 00:20:53.755
If it's too much for you
with your injuries, you...

00:20:54.391 --> 00:20:57.417
I'll go, if you're serious...

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:02.863
I was attacked by one of the Juttensen.

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:06.595
That means the situation has
reached the point of no return.

00:21:06.737 --> 00:21:09.672
I need to see Tenshi
as quickly as possible.

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:12.170
Yeah, me too.

00:21:12.643 --> 00:21:16.841
Hmm? Hey! Am I the
odd one out this time?

00:21:21.285 --> 00:21:22.513
What?

00:21:22.686 --> 00:21:25.246
What's so funny? Damn it!

00:21:25.356 --> 00:21:27.051
You are such a kid.

00:21:27.191 --> 00:21:28.556
What did you say?

00:21:31.962 --> 00:21:34.760
I see, Souma was...

00:21:34.932 --> 00:21:35.626
Yes.

00:21:35.933 --> 00:21:38.424
And the next assassin?

00:21:38.535 --> 00:21:40.696
Already discharged.

00:21:42.439 --> 00:21:47.877
The Blade Bard Senshi, Sanzo Souma,
was laid to rest by the fugitive?

00:21:48.879 --> 00:21:50.870
How embarrassing.

00:21:51.282 --> 00:21:52.249
And so?

00:21:52.549 --> 00:21:55.416
You're asking me to finish the job?

00:21:55.552 --> 00:21:58.180
What a bit part I've been thrown.

00:21:59.089 --> 00:22:01.785
Wow! Nice body!

00:22:02.293 --> 00:22:03.590
Gladly!

00:22:04.094 --> 00:22:05.652
Huh? But...

00:22:06.030 --> 00:22:08.863
Is this girl... Rushuna?

00:22:15.873 --> 00:22:25.509
<i>All alone,
so many nights I want to cry.</i>

00:22:26.583 --> 00:22:36.254
<i>Everyone dreams on
the road of the endless journey.</i>

00:22:37.561 --> 00:22:42.794
<i>Always believe in something,
and always lose something.</i>

00:22:42.966 --> 00:22:47.027
<i>I hold you.</i>

00:22:48.105 --> 00:22:55.841
<i>All the tears I shed
will turn into kindness.</i>

00:22:56.180 --> 00:22:58.273
<i>I'm sure.</i>

00:22:58.549 --> 00:23:03.680
<i>Don't be defeated by sadness.</i>

00:23:03.887 --> 00:23:09.325
<i>Keep your eye on tomorrow.</i>

00:23:09.526 --> 00:23:19.527
<i>You're not alone.
Everyone has dreams to come true.</i>

00:23:19.870 --> 00:23:30.678
<i>The winds of tomorrow will
bring the fragrance of kindness.</i>

00:23:30.848 --> 00:23:41.452
<i>It's a promise...
I'll always be by your side.</i>

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:45.528
<i>Next Episode</i>

00:23:45.929 --> 00:23:48.625
Yet another one of the
Juttensen attacks us.

00:23:48.732 --> 00:23:52.133
Huh? A close look reveals
it's a childhood friend!

00:23:52.369 --> 00:23:55.304
He's been a pervert and
a klutz since we were kids.

00:23:55.472 --> 00:23:58.373
It looks like he's grown up a lot.

00:23:58.542 --> 00:24:00.237
Has he changed?

00:24:00.411 --> 00:24:04.177
I'm sure he's still
a pervert and a klutz!

00:24:04.348 --> 00:24:09.911
Next episode of "Grenadier,"
An enemy from the past, Teppa Aizen.

00:24:10.053 --> 00:24:12.283
Would you like to join me?
